.magicbricks.com/Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Image 28: Malabar Hill Video](https://img.youtube.com/vi/wdH78mpwUO4/hqdefault.jpg)\n\n4.4\n\n57 reviews\n\nRank\n\n6 out of 3015 localities \n\nLocality Average Price\n\n₹ 80936/sq.ft + ₹11610 (16.7% ) QoQ\n\nLocality introduction and neighbourhood\n\n[Explore Malabar Hill](https://www.magicbricks.com/Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n## About Lodha Developers Limited\n\n![Image 29: Lodha Developers Limited](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/photo_dir/developer/original_images/54016/1781002513599-54016.jpg)\n\n[Lodha Developers Limited](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-developers-limited-buid-4d423534303136)46 Years Experience\n\nOne Lodha Place, Senapati Bapat Marg, Lower Parel, Mumbai 400013, India\n\nTotal Projects\n\n399\n\nProjects Completed\n\n172\n\nProjects Ongoing\n\n227\n\nExplore Builder Contact \n\nLodha is India's leading real estate brand, devoted to creating some of the world's finest developments, where timeless architecture, crafted interior... Read More\n\nAbout Developer\n\nLodha is India's leading real estate brand, devoted to creating some of the world's finest developments, where timeless architecture, crafted interiors and thoughtful hospitality come together to create environments of enduring beauty and value. With over four decades of experience, Lodha has shaped landmark developments across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region, Pune, Bengaluru, Delhi NCR and London.\n\nThe brand creates exceptional residential, commercial and retail developments, as well as offices and warehousing, collaborating with internationally renowned architects, designers and consultants including Pei Cobb Freed & Partners, Eric Parry Architects, PLP Architecture, Yabu Pushelberg, Patricia Urquiola and Giorgio Armani. What sets Lodha apart is its savoir-faire: the ability to orchestrate world-class talent, refined craftsmanship and a culture of thoughtful service into one seamless experience.\n\nIts portfolio includes some of India's most iconic developments, such as Lodha Altamount, Lodha World Towers, Lodha Malabar, Lodha Sea Face, Lodha Avalon and One Lodha Place in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Beyond Mumbai, Lodha Belmondo in Pune and Lodha Alibaug are 100-acre resort developments, while Palava is one of India's largest privately planned integrated cities. In London, Lodha has established a presence through three residential developments, including the restoration of No. 1 Grosvenor Square in Mayfair, one of the world's most prestigious residential addresses.\n\nLodha is the only Indian real estate brand featured in Newsweek's World's Most Trustworthy Companies 2025.\n\n[![Image 30: Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/magic-Interior_878-x-403.jpg)](https://property.magicbricks.com/microsite/lp/patabadlolifebadlo/?inc=pblb_web_pdp_pblbbanner_belowhibannere)\n\nIf you like Lodha Waterview,\n\nDon't miss these similar projects\n\n![Image 31](https://cdn.staticmb.com/pdpstatic/images/logo-magic-homes-animation.svg)\n\n![Image 32: HM Central Park photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2024/07/04/Project-Photo-2-Central-Park-Mumbai-5336199_345_1366_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 16.83 Cr - 39.45 Cr\n\n[HM Central Park](https://www.magicbricks.com/hm-central-park-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333336313939)\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n5 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 33: Runwal Malabar photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2026/08/17/Project-Photo-8-Runwal-Malabar-Mumbai-5445595_410_1440_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 30 Cr - 30 Cr\n\n[Runwal Malabar](https://www.magicbricks.com/runwal-malabar-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343435353935)\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n3 BHK\n\nView Phone No.\n\n![Image 34: Birla Anayu photo](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h240_w0/2025/12/11/Project-Photo-2-Birla-Anayu-Mumbai-5440457_691_823_240_0.jpg)\n\n₹ 58.65 Cr - 58.65 Cr\n\n[Birla Anayu](https://www.magicbricks.com/birla-anayu