mbai is 400006.\n\n### What is the address of Lodha Waterview?\n\nThe address of Lodha Waterview is Lodha Waterview, Plot No 310 And 311, Cumballa Hill, Malabar Hill, South Mumbai, Mumbai, 400006.\n\n### How many units are in Lodha Waterview?\n\nLodha Waterview has a total of 11 units.\n\n### What is the total area of Lodha Waterview?\n\nLodha Waterview in Mumbai spans a total area of 1 acres.\n\n### Which is nearest bus stop to Lodha Waterview?\n\nDarya Mahal Bus Stop is located near to the Lodha Waterview. It is the only nearest bus stop & is located at a distance of 0.2 Kms.\n\n### What are other residential projects near Lodha Waterview?\n\n[Kalpataru Prive](https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-prive-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333535383537), [Kalpataru Kshitij](https://www.magicbricks.com/kalpataru-kshitij-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313230383833), [Runwal Malabar](https://www.magicbricks.com/runwal-malabar-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343435353935), [Malabar Apartments](https://www.magicbricks.com/malabar-apartments-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313134333837) and [Aurum Girnar](https://www.magicbricks.com/aurum-girnar-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343431303133) are other popular residential projects near Lodha Waterview. \n\n### How many towers in Lodha Waterview?\n\nLodha Waterview has a total of 1 towers in different unit configurations.\n\n### What is the RERA number of Lodha Waterview?\n\nThe RERA number of Lodha Waterview is P51900055626. You can easily find it on RERA official website.\n\nShow more\n\ni\n\nThis project was last updated on 23 August 2026\n\nProperties for Sale\n\n*   [Properties for Sale in Lodha Waterview](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-lodha-waterview-3bhk-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Properties for Sale in Lodha Waterview](https://www.magicbricks.com/project-lodha-waterview-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n\nQuick Links\n\n*   [Lodha Waterview Photos Videos](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-waterview-photo-videos-mal