ectivity in Mumbai Metropolitan Region. Follow this blog to know about the routes and stations of Mumbai Metro network.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-metro/127715.html)\n\n[![Image 53: Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/11/inside-salman-khan-house-galaxy_300_450.jpg) Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai The 'Bhai' of Bollywood, Salman Khan is an avid investor. While he enjoys a grounded lifestyle, he owns many properties that add to his net worth. Check out Salman Khan's house in Galaxy Apartments and other places.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-salman-khan-house/125451.html)\n\n[![Image 54: Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/harbour-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg) Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More This blog delves into one of the three lines of Mumbai local trains -the Harbour Line Mumbai. The Harbour Line splits into two from Wadala Road, with one line heading to Navi Mumbai and another to Goregaon. Learn more.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/harbour-line-mumbai/131092.html)\n\n[![Image 55: Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/central-line-mumbai_300_450.jpg) Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More The Mumbai Central Line is a very vital suburban railway network within the city, with routes from CSMT to Kalyan, Kasara and Khopoli. Learn the details regarding the routes, stations, train timings, fare structure and interchange points.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/central-line-mumbai/131048.html)\n\n[![Image 56: Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route_300_450.jpg) Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route, or the Mumbai Metro Line 1, connects the central and western suburbs. The Mumbai metro Line 1 is fully operational and was one of the first lines to be operational in Mumbai. Know more about Versova Andheri Ghatkopar Metro - also called the Reliance Metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/versova-ghatkopar-metro-route/131129.html)\n\n[![Image 57: Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/4/yellow-line-mumbai-metro-2A_300_450.jpg) Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B The Mumbai Metro Yellow line is segmented into two parts, i.e. line 2A and 2B. The Line 2B has recently become partially operational.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/yellow-line-metro-route-mumbai/130113.html)\n\n[![Image 58: Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/2/western-line-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More The local train network of Mumbai is the heart of the city. In this vast network, Western Line Mumbai is one of the most important railway lines. This blog provides a deeper look into this railway line.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/western-line-mumbai/131117.html)\n\n[![Image 59: Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/FI-mumbai-vs-delhi-bengaluru_300_450.jpg) Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property? India's luxury housing market is set to nearly double by 2031 but not every city offers the same opportunity. Here's a real estate investment guide for HNIs in 2026 and why it matters.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/which-city-should-hnis-invest-in-luxury-property-jymb/151181.html)\n\n[![Image 60: Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2021/1/rates%20CMS%203_300_450.jpg) Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27 Ready reckoner in Mumbai is affected by the age and location of the property. Also, I know how to check the ready reckoner rate on the Maharashtra government website.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/ready-rekoner-rates-in-mumbai/118403.html)\n\n[![Image 61: Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/Mumbai-Ahmedabad-Bullet-Train_300_450.jpg) Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule The upcoming Mumbai Ahmedabad bullet train transforms connectivity, boosts property values, and opens new real estate investment hubs across tier-2 cities along its 508 km corridor.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mumbai-ahmedabad-bullet-train-jkmb/150885.html)\n\n[![Image 62: Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2023/5/MHADA-Lottery-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility MHADA Mumbai Lottery offers affordable residential units for the homeless. The post covers active Mumbai MHADA Lottery schemes, with dates, eligibility criteria, documents, and payment information for the same.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/mhada-lottery-mumbai/132034.html)\n\n[![Image 63: The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/8/rise--of-mira-bhayandar-in-mumbai-metropolitan-region_300_450.jpg) The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Mira Bhayandar micro market has undergone a radical economic metamorphosis. The area is becoming a self-contained urban center through better transportation, civic facilities, organized retail, and education, among other factors.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/rise-of-mira-bhayandar-in-mumbai-metropolitan-region/150744.html)\n\n[![Image 64: Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2022/10/bhumi-pednekar-house_300_450.jpg) Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More Bhumi Pednekar doesn’t need any introduction. This blog covers everything you need to know about her lavish sea-facing apartment in Mumbai. Read on.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-bhumi-pednekar-house/129959.html)\n\n[![Image 65: Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2026/6/FI-Asalpha-Metro-Station-Mumbai_300_450.jpg) Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know Asalpha metro is an important station on Mumbai's Blue Line. Learn about its location, timings, facilities and the growing demand for real estate near the Asalpha metro.](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/asalpha-metro-station-on-mumbai-blue-line-kamb/149707.html)\n\n[![Image 66: John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More](https://img.staticmb.com/mbcontent/images/crop/uploads/2025/11/john-abraham-house_300_450.jpg) John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More John Abraham leads a luxurious life in his Bandra West residence. The actor own several other properties in and outside of India. Here's all you need to know about John Abraham's house. Scroll down!](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/celeb-homes-john-abraham-house/130085.html)\n\nLooking for a Property in Lodha Waterview\n\nYour Name \n\nEmail \n\nMobile Number \n\nI Agree to MagicBricks' [Terms of Use](https://www.magicbricks.com/lodha-waterview-malabar-hill-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343430393335#)\n\nGet Contact Details\n\nAbout Magicbricks\n\nMagicbricks, India's leading real estate ecosystem, brings together everything consumers need to navigate their real estate journey with confidence. With 2M+ property listings and trusted market intelligence, we help consumers discover, evaluate and make informed property decisions.\n\nFrom property search and locality insights to AI-powered valuation through PropWorth, home loans, interiors and other home services, Magicbricks offers an integrated suite of solutions that supports consumers at every stage of their real estate journey.\n\nTrusted by millions. Powered by technology. Built on 20+ years of real estate expertise.\n\n*   [](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.timesgroup.magicbricks&referrer=utm_source=MobileAppBanner)\n*   [](https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/magicbricks/id486328406?ls=1&mt=8&referrer=utm_source=MobileAppBanner)\n*   [](https://www.facebook.com/magicbricks \"Facebook\")\n*   [](https://twitter.com/magicbricks \"Twitter\")\n*   [](https://in.linkedin.com/company/magicbricks \"Linkedin\")\n*   [](https://www.youtube.com/user/magicbricksvideo \"youtube MBTV\")\n*   [](https://www.instagram.com/magicbricks_official/ \"Instagram\")\n\nProperties in India\n\n*   [Property in New Delhi](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-new-delhi-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-chennai-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-pune-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Noida](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-noida-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Gurgaon](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-gurgaon-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Bangalore](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-bangalore-pppfs)\n*   [Property in Ahmedabad](https://www.magicbricks.com/property-for-sale-in-ahmedabad-pppfs)\n\nNew Projects in India\n\n*   [New Projects in New Delhi](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-New-Delhi)\n*   [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Mumbai)\n*   [New Projects in Chennai](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Chennai)\n*   [New Projects in Pune](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Pune)\n*   [New Projects in Noida](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Noida)\n*   [New Projects in Gurgaon](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Gurgaon)\n*   [New Projects in Bangalore](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Bangalore)\n*   [New Projects in Ahmedabad](https://www.magicbricks.com/new-projects-Ahmedabad)\n*   [MagicHomes](https://www.magicbricks.com/magichomes)\n\nProperty Services\n\n*   [Home Loan](https://www.magicbricks.com/homeloan/home?inc=homeloan_footer_property_services_home_loan_link)\n*   [Home Interior](https://www.magicbricks.com/home-interior/)\n\n*   [Sitemap](https://www.magicbricks.com/sitemap.html)\n*   [Terms & Conditions](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/terms.html)\n*   [Privacy Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/privacy-policy.html)\n*   [Whistle Blower Policy](https://property.magicbricks.com/terms/whistle-blower-policy.html)\n*   [Blog](https://www.magicbricks.com/blog/)\n*   [Careers](https://www.magicbricks.com/careers)\n*   [Testimonials](https://property.magicbricks.com/testimonials/testimonials.htm)\n*   [Unsubscribe](https://www.magicbricks.com/mbutility/unSubEmail)\n*   [Help Center](https://www.magicbricks.com/help/)\n*   [Sales Enquiry](https://www.magicbricks.com/contactUs)\n*   [Buy Services](https://www.magicbricks.com/advertise-with-us)\n*   [News](https://www.magicbricks.com/news/)\n\nDisclaimer: Magicbricks Realty Services Limited is only an intermediary offering its platform to advertise properties of Seller for a Customer/Buyer/User coming on its Website and is not and cannot be a party to or privy to or control in any manner any transactions between the Seller and the Customer/Buyer/User. All the offers and discounts on this Website have been extended by Read more various Builder(s)/Developer(s) who have advertised their products. Magicbricks is only communicating the offers and not selling or rendering any of those products or services. It neither warrants nor is it making any representations with respect to offer(s) made on the site. Magicbricks Realty Services Limited shall neither be responsible nor liable to mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobrokerage.com/project/details/lodha-malabar-walkeshwar-malabar-hill-mumbai-689041","title":"Lodha Malabar, Malabar hill, Mumbai | NoBrokerage.com","raw_content":"![Loading...](/Loader.webp)\n\n* [![Home](/icons/home_quick_link.svg)Home](/)\n* [![Search](/icons/search_quick_link.svg)Search](/search)\n* [![Property](/icons/Add_quick_link.svg)Property](/form/postproperty)\n* [![Profile](/icons/profile_quick_link.svg)Profile](/dashboard)\n\n![Lodha Malabar banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822918-45685fd1412a62fe.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Lodha Malabar mobile banner](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822916-c87644182ca1d883.jpg)\n\n![Developer Logo 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/project/builder-logos/lodha-malabar/builderlogos-lodha-logo-png-0763d9.png)\n\nPalaces by the sea\n\n![Project details background](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822915-5bd0286e4a60a29d.jpg)\n\n![Project Icon](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-a73460d34ece82cd.png)\n\nPresenting\n\n## 4 & 5 BHK Homes\n\nStarting from₹ 65.05 Cr\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nLast Updated : 04 Sept, 2026\n\nLodha Malabar\n\nBROKERAGE FREE\n\n[By Lodha Developers Limited](/builder/lodha \"Open Lodha Developers Limited page\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n₹ 65.05 – 112.88 Cr+ Charges\n\nEMI starts at ₹ 56.45 Lac / M\n\nUnder Construction\n\nCompletion In 28 Jun 2027 Onwards\n\nLodha Malabar offers exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" on Walkeshwar Road, an elite South Mumbai location. The project uniquely borders the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Residents benefit from Club Saint Amand, a private members' club, and a life orchestrated by the luxury hospitality experts, Saint Amand. It offers large format 4 & 5 BHK, Duplex, and Penthouse options. The MahaRERA registration number is P51900034949.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n4390.96 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n1\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n36\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400006\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nMalabar Hill\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nLodha Malabar, Krishanaraj Society, Sea Face, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n4 BHK3,826 - 4036.79 sq.ft\n\n₹ 65.05 – 68.63 Crore\n\n5 BHK6,271 - 6640.25 sq.ft\n\n₹ 106.61 – 112.88 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n4 BHK₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 65.05 Cr\n\n3826sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 65.05 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n4 BHK₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![4 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n### 4 BHK\n\n₹ 68.63 Cr\n\n4036.79sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 68.63 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/4bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Aug 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nLodha Malabar is a collection of exclusive \"Palaces by the sea\" located in South Mumbai's finest location, on the iconic Walkeshwar Road. The project commands an unmatched address, positioned directly opposite the Governor's estate and touching both the Arabian Sea and the historic Hanging Gardens. This prime positioning places the world literally at the residents' feet. A central feature of the development is Club Saint Amand, a private member's club meticulously conceived around active, social, and leisure lifestyles of its privileged residents. The living experience is orchestrated for seamless comfort and luxury, managed by the discreet and expert touch of the luxury hospitality service, Saint Amand. This service ensures that residents receive world-class attention and a perfectly choreographed life. Lodha Malabar offers Duplex/Pent House/4 & 5 BHK residences. The project is officially registered via the MahaRERA registration number P51900034949.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/fire-safety-system-copy-332581.png)\n\nFire Safety System\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/club-house-a73a39.png)\n\nClubhouse\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/security-guards.svg)\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/dg-backup-fe3944.png)\n\nDg Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/lounge-area.svg)\n\nLounge Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/deck.svg)\n\nDeck\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cab-pickup-and-drop-off-point-3abc78.png)\n\nCab Pickup And Dropoff Point\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/balcony.svg)\n\nBalcony\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/designer-bathroom-tiles.svg)\n\nDesigner Bathroom Tiles\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/glass-partitions-in-bathrooms.svg)\n\nGlass Partitions In Bathrooms\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n![Brochure Page 1](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/brochures/cmid2hdbv00hasa6x3c2vhj6a/v1/page_1_full.webp)\n\n1of2\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalabar Hill is one of Mumbai’s most prestigious and luxurious residential areas, known for sea-view living and exclusive neighbourhood standards. It features high-end apartments, iconic mansions, and secure, private surroundings. With limited inventory and elite demand, property values here continually rise over time. The locality blends tranquillity with proximity to major South Mumbai business areas, making it a prized lifestyle and investment destination.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765372822917-b56438044a26f42e.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51900034949\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Lodha](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/14/IMAGE/lodha-logo-jpg-a3a8a1.jpg)](/builder/lodha \"Lodha\")\n\nLodha![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –46 years\n\nLodha Group, operating under Macrotech Developers, is unequivocally one of India's foremost and largest real estate companies, established with a vision for creating world-class residential and commercial landmarks since 1980. Their developer features include a significant emphasis on scale and timely delivery, having successfully completed millions of square feet of development across Mumbai, Pune, and other metropolitan areas. The company's hallmark is its commitment to high-quality construction and an uncompromised customer-centric approach, which has cemented their reputation for building highly desirable properties. Being listed on the BSE and NSE, the group adheres to stringent corporate governance and financial transparency. Lodha specializes in creating large-scale estates that offer holistic living experiences, integrating advanced security, modern infrastructure, and exclusive lifestyle amenities.\n\n80ProjectsCompleted\n\n30OngoingProjects\n\n4In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Lodha Malabar in West Pune\n\nLodha Malabar is developed by Lodha Developers Limited, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nLodha Malabar is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Lodha Malabar at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Lodha Malabar is expected by Jun 2027, as per the RERA filing.\n\nLodha Malabar falls under the STANDALONE housing segment, making it an ideal choice for homebuyers and investors.\n\nThe RERA registration number(s) for Lodha Malabar are P51900034949. You can verify these details on the official state RERA portal.\n\nThe total plot area of Lodha Malabar is 4390.96 SQM, thoughtfully planned for maximum green and recreational spaces.\n\nKey nearby highlights from Lodha Malabar include Aparna Bhuta, Gopi Birla Memorial School, Birla Open Minds International School Walkeshwar and more within easy reach for daily needs.\n\nLodha Malabar offers 5 BHK, 4 BHK apartments, each designed for modern comfortable living.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar offers dedicated parking for residents, ensuring convenience and security for personal vehicles.\n\nLodha Malabar consists of 1 towers with 36 floors each, offering a premium vertical living experience.\n\nYes, Lodha Malabar is being developed by the developer, a RERA-registered entity ensuring legal and timely construction.\n\nThe carpet area of apartments in Lodha Malabar ranges from 3826 sq.ft sq.ft for 4 BHK to 6640.25 sq.ft sq.ft for 5 BHK, depending on the configuration.\n\nLodha Malabar is currently Under Construction in the area, the city. The project is progressing as per RERA timelines.\n\nThe pricing for units in Lodha Malabar starts from ₹65.05 Cr - ₹112.88 Cr.\n\nLodha Malabar comprises multiple residential units designed to cater to different family sizes and preferences.\n\nFlats in Lodha Malabar include multiple bathrooms and multiple spacious balconies, providing well-planned space for privacy and leisure.\n\nLodha Malabar offers a wide range of amenities including Fire Safety System, Security, Clubhouse, Security Guards, 24 7 Water Supply, 24x7 Security, Cctv Surveillance, Dg Backup, Lounge Area, Deck, Cab Pickup And Dropoff Point, Balcony, Designer Bathroom Tiles, Glass Partitions In Bathrooms, Maid Helper Room, Cab Pickup Point, Basic Amenities, Fire Alarm, Fire Rated Doors, Security Cabin, Seating Area, Vitrified Tile Flooring, 24/7 Electricity Backup, Smart Lighting, Fire Fighting System, Car Parking, Lift, Sit Out Area, Service Lift , Double Height Living Room, Branded Fittings & Fixtures, False Ceiling With Led Lighting, Anti Skid Flooring In Bathrooms.\n\nThe price of apartments in this project starts at ₹65.05 Cr per sq.ft, offering great value in the real estate market.\n\nLodha Malabar is 