upted views of the Arabian Sea and surrounding greenery, creating a level of exclusivity that is increasingly rare in South Mumbai\n\n## Lodha Malabar Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Lodha Malabar.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  3843 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 4 BHK Apartment  4643 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n| 5 BHK Apartment  6271 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Get Payment Plan |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nLodha Malabar's average asking price is cooling quarter-on-quarter, compared with Malabar Hill.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Lodha Malabar | Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 79200 | 80650 |\n| Mar 2026 | 129550 | 95700 |\n| Dec 2025 | 129500 | 92350 |\n| Sep 2025 | 100850 | 76750 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nLodha Malabar avg. price is ₹ 79.2 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Malabar Hill at ₹ 80.7 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Kalpataru Azuro](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-azuro/175958/project \"Kalpataru Azuro\") | ₹ 1.56 L |\n| [Birla Anayu](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/birla-anayu/311961/project \"Birla Anayu\") | ₹ 1.21 L |\n| [Godrej Carmichael](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/godrej-carmichael/239033/project \"Godrej Carmichael\") | ₹ 86,050 |\n| Malabar Hill | ₹ 80,650 |\n| Current Project **Lodha Malabar** | ₹ 79,200 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Malabar Hill ranges from ₹ 97.1 K to ₹ 4.9 L with options available for 1,2,3,4 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Lodha Malabar | In Malabar Hill |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 97.1 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 2 L |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 3.8 L |\n| 4 BHK | - | ₹ 4.9 L |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Lodha Malabar.\n\nA total of 2 residential transactions has been registered so far for Lodha Malabar, amounting to ₹ 98 Cr till September 2026.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Lodha Malabar moved from ₹ 129,500/sqft to ₹ 129,550/sqft, reflecting a 0.04% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 65% completion, Internal finishing stands at 5%.\n\nStructural Works reach 65% completion, Internal finishing stands at 6%.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Lodha Malabar moved from ₹ 100,850/sqft to ₹ 129,500/sqft, reflecting a 28.41% rise.\n\nStructural Works reach 58% completion, Internal finishing stands at 3%.\n\nA total of 2 out of 61 launched units have been booked as of December 2025, including 40% of 2 BHK(2 out of 5 units).\n\nStructural Works reach 51% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 50% completion.\n\nStructural Works reach 48% completion.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Lodha Malabar From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 1.1 L/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 | ₹ 98 Cr | ₹ 1.14 L / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Lodha Malabar Floor Plans\n\nThe residences at Lodha Malabar have been planned to offer exceptional privacy, generous proportions, and uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea and the Hanging Gardens. Rather than following repetitive layouts, every residence has been individually designed to maximise natural light, ventilation, and panoramic vistas. Floor-to-ceiling glazing, expansive living spaces, and thoughtfully positioned outdoor decks create homes that seamlessly connect with their surroundings.\n\n### Lodha Malabar Apartment Configurations\n\nUnit sizes from 3843 Sq.Ft. to 6271 Sq.Ft.\n\nHomes available in 4, 5 BHK configurations\n\n### Key Highlights of Lodha Malabar Floor Plans\n\nEvery residence at Lodha Malabar has been designed to deliver a private and refined living experience, where spacious interiors complement one of South Mumbai's most prestigious locations.\n\n#### Individually Designed Residences\n\nUnlike conventional developments with repetitive apartment layouts, each residence has been planned independently, giving every home a distinct character while making optimum use of space and natural surroundings.\n\n#### Expansive Living & Entertainment Areas\n\nThe floor plans feature large living and dining spaces that comfortably accommodate family life as well as formal entertaining. Open layouts create a seamless transition between different areas of the home while maintaining privacy for personal spaces.\n\n#### Floor-to-Ceiling Glazing\n\nLarge glass panels extend from floor to ceiling, allowing abundant daylight into the residences while framing uninterrupted views of the Arabian Sea, Hanging Gardens, and the South Mumbai skyline.\n\n#### Spacious Private Decks\n\nEach residence incorporates generous outdoor decks that function as an extension of the living space, providing residents with private areas to relax while enjoying panoramic sea and garden views.\n\n#### Privacy-Oriented Planning\n\nThe residences have been planned to offer a high degree of exclusivity through spacious layouts, carefully positioned living areas, and efficient circulation, ensuring a peaceful residential environment that reflects the project's luxury positioning.\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 3843 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 4 BHK 4643 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 5 BHK 6271 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Lodha Malabar, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Lodha Malabar\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and w