-malabar-project-project-large-image1-3945.jpg?aio=w-112;h-96;crop;)\n\nPlease select the starting point to calculate the travel time.\n\n![Rolling loader icon](/assets/images/rolling-loader.gif)\n\n### Nearby Landmarks\n\n#### Gopi Birla Memorial School\n\n#### White House\n\n#### Desa Hospital\n\n### Connecting Roads\n\nAverage Asking Price in Malabar Hill\n\nBased on active listings and recent trends\n\n![Locality rank](/assets/images/key-insights-icon/locality-rank.svg)\n\nBased on demand, livability, and activity\n\nMalabar Hill remains one of the peaceful and scenic localities in Mumbai. The abundance of lush green spaces like Hanging Gardens and Kamala Nehru Park, combined with stunning views of the Arabian Sea, offers a serene escape from the city's fast pace. The roads are well-maintained, street lighting is good, and the neighborhood feels safe even late at night. Access to top-tier schools, premier healthcare facilities, and South Mumbai's key business hubs makes living here incredibly convenient and comfortable.\n\n— SOURABH, Owner\n\n## RERA Details of Lodha Malabar\n\nLodha Malabar is registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA) with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626 The registration enables prospective buyers to verify official project information before proceeding with a purchase.\n\nThe MahaRERA registration provides access to important project-related information, including:\n\n* Approved project plans\n* Construction progress\n* Possession timeline\n* Statutory approvals\n* Developer disclosures\n* Regulatory compliance\n\nReviewing these records allows buyers to independently verify project details while ensuring greater transparency throughout the home-buying process.\n\nLodha Malabar is registered under the Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority (MahaRERA) with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626 The registration enables prospective buyers to verify official project information before proceeding with a purchase.\n\nThe MahaRERA registration provides access to important project-related information, including:\n\nApproved project plans\n\nConstruction progress\n\nPossession timeline\n\nStatutory approvals\n\nDeveloper disclosures\n\nRegulatory compliance\n\nReviewing these records allows buyers to independently verify project details while ensuring greater transparency throughout the home-buying process.\n\n## Property Registration Data\n\n2 Sales Transactions Registered in Lodha Malabar From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 1.1 L/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Registry Date | Floor/Unit | Tower/Wing | Area | Transaction Value | Rate/Sq. Ft. | Actions |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-01-29 | Floor 8, Unit 801 | Palaces, B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-10-24 | Floor 6, Unit 601 | B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n| 2025-09-30 | Floor 7, Unit 701 | B | 4,456 Sq. Ft. |  |  | Index    Agreement |\n\n## How does Lodha Malabar compare with similar projects?\n\n![Lodha Malabar project in Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-malabar-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Lodha Malabar](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-malabar/208302/project \"Lodha Malabar\")\n\nMalabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![DB Realty Orchid Heights project in Mahalaxmi, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-db-realty-orchid-heights-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [DB Realty Orchid Heights](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/db-realty-orchid-heights/2844/project \"DB Realty Orchid Heights\")\n\nMahalaxmi, Mumbai\n\n![Raheja Excelsior project in Tardeo, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-raheja-excelsior-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Raheja Excelsior](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/raheja-excelsior/3061/project \"Raheja Excelsior\")\n\nTardeo, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## Lodha Malabar Reviews & Ratings\n\nRead the reviews about Lodha Malabar located at Malabar Hill Mumbai and see what residents and real estate experts have to say about the project.\n\nReal estate agent\n\nThis project stands out for its prime location and quality construction. Clients appreciate the modern amenities.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar stands as an architectural marvel with an oceanic panorama, presenting residents with an unparalleled view of the sea. The project's design philosophy reflects a perfect fusion of aesthetics and functionality, providing residents with a sophisticated living experience. Beyond the intricately designed residences, expansive windows and balconies capture the vastness of the ocean, creating an atmosphere of grandeur. Lodha Malabar is not merely a living space; it's a masterpiece that transcends trends, offering residents an enduring symbol of coastal elegance.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar is a coastal green oasis seamlessly integrated with urban vibrancy. The project incorporates eco-friendly practices and sustainable design elements, creating a residence where residents can live in harmony with both nature and the city. Lush green spaces and environmentally conscious features reflect Lodha Malabar's commitment to creating a sustainable and healthy living environment. It is an ideal choice for those who appreciate the serenity of coastal living within the dynamic urban landscape.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar redefines connectivity and seaside serenity, placing residents at the heart of coastal vibrancy. Strategically located, the project ensures seamless access to key destinations, including business districts, educational institutions, and entertainment hubs. The convenience of modern living is elevated, making Lodha Malabar a coveted address for those who seek a lifestyle seamlessly integrated with the rhythmic charm of the sea. It's not merely a residence; it's a gateway to a life where connectivity and coastal serenity converge for a well-rounded seaside living experience.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar celebrates cultural harmony by the coastal breeze, creating a living environment that resonates with residents from diverse cultural backgrounds. The residences showcase a blend of design elements inspired by coastal aesthetics, fostering an inclusive community. Communal spaces become hubs for cultural exchange, contributing to a vibrant tapestry of experiences within the community. Lodha Malabar is not just a coastal residence; it's a microcosm of cultural richness, where every resident adds to the harmonious blend of coastal living.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar exemplifies a sustainable coastal retreat, setting a new standard for responsible coastal development. The project incorporates eco-friendly practices, energy-efficient systems, and green initiatives, reflecting a commitment to environmental responsibility. Residents enjoy luxurious coastal living while actively contributing to a greener future. Lodha Malabar is a symbol of conscientious coastal living, where sustainability and luxury coalesce seamlessly, providing residents with a coastal residence that aligns with their values for a greener lifestyle.\n\nOwner\n\nI love my flat. The gym is top-notch, and the connectivity makes commuting easy.\n\nOwner\n\nOur family loves the spacious apartments and the peaceful environment. It's a great place to raise kids.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar epitomizes coastal elegance and modern luxury, offering residents a unique living experience by the sea. The project's architectural design seamlessly integrates with the coastal surroundings, providing breathtaking views and a sense of tranquility. Each residence becomes a private sanctuary, capturing the essence of coastal living while maintaining the highest standards of modern luxury. Lodha Malabar is not just a residence; it's a coastal retreat where residents can indulge in the beauty of the sea without compromising on urban comfort.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar excels as a seaside haven, featuring family-centric spaces designed for modern coastal living. Spacious interiors provide ample room for family gatherings and activities, fostering a sense of togetherness. With dedicated areas for relaxation and communal spaces, the project creates an environment where families can thrive amidst the soothing backdrop of the sea. Lodha Malabar is more than just a residence; it is a carefully crafted space that transforms living into an enriching experience for every family member.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar introduces coastal tranquility combined with tech-savvy comfort, offering residents a modern living experience by the sea. The project seamlessly integrates smart home features and cutting-edge technology, providing residents with convenience and control at their fingertips. Lodha Malabar is not just a coastal residence; it's a futuristic haven where residents can enjoy the serenity of the sea while embracing the conveniences of a technologically advanced lifestyle.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar prioritizes wellness-centric coastal living, offering residents a holistic environment where the sea and well-being coexist. State-of-the-art fitness facilities, yoga spaces, and serene landscaped areas contribute to an atmosphere of calm and rejuvenation. The project is not merely about coastal luxury; it's an invitation to embrace a lifestyle that seamlessly integrates modern comfort with a focus on holistic wellness. Lodha Malabar is a haven for those who seek a coastal residence that caters to their overall well-being.\n\nOwner\n\nLodha Malabar redefines connectivity while offering oceanic opulence, placing residents at the forefront of coastal vibrancy. The strategic location ensures seamless access to urban amenities, business districts, and cultural centers, all with the breathtaking backdrop of the ocean. The convenience of modern coastal living is elevated, making Lodha Malabar a sought-after address for those who seek a lifestyle seamlessly integrated with the rhythmic charm of the sea. It's not just a coastal residence; it's a gateway to a life where connectivity and coastal opulence converge for a well-rounded seaside living experience.\n\nOwner\n\nWhile the area is nice, I was hoping for greater returns on my investment. The appreciation hasn't lived up to my expectations.\n\nTenant\n\nThe facilities are wonderful, but I feel maintenance can be better.\n\n## Lodha Track Record\n\n![Lodha logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/lodha-521-6366.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nMr Mangal Prabhat Lodha started the Lodha Group in 1980. This 42-year-old corporation has constructed 85 million square feet, done INR 50,000Cr+ business, and delivered 50,000+ residences between 2016 and 2022. They have real estate in London, Pune, Mumbai, and Hyderabad. They are accomplishing their purpose of Building a Better Life for all of their clients as a real estate firm.\nSome of the best-featured products of Lodha Group are  Lodha Bellevue, Lodha Splendora, Amara, Codename Central, and Lodha Belmondo. And other top-notch ongoing projects are No 1 Grosvenor Square, Lodha Maison, World One, Lodha Ciel, World View, The World Towers, Lodha Park - Trump Tower Mumbai, Lodha Park - Marquise, Lodha Evoq, New Cuffe Parade, Lodha Park, Lodha Primo, Lodha Aura, New Cuffe Parade, etc. \nCurrently, there are 40 and more ongoing projects under the Lodha group, whereas 30 and more projects are going to be launched very soon. Their mission of building a better future and creating leaders for tomorrow goes hand-in-hand. Their amazing work has been rewarded with several certificates and awards worldwide during the time-period of 2014 to 2022.\n\n![Lodha Aureus residential project in Sewri](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-aureus-project-flagship-opt-b1aedb56-f1d6-486e-8260-653863e822cc.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSewri, Mumbai\n\n3, 4 BHK Apartment, Retail Shop\n\n₹ 4.60 Cr to 10.70 Cr\n\n![Lodha Elaris residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-elaris-project-flagship-opt-a6f5ff23-11cd-42f5-bb1a-134e90c6e093.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n4 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 9.00 Cr\n\n![Lodha Worli residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-worli-project-flagship-opt-bc0b8b13-1b11-4d39-b3eb-487a1ad88d79.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\n2, 3, 4 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Lodha Sovrano residential project in Jogeshwari West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-sovrano-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nJogeshwari West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.99 Cr to 3.63 Cr\n\n![Lodha Corinthia residential project in Bhandup West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-corinthia-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBhandup West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 2.35 Cr to 3.20 Cr\n\n![Lodha Vikhroli residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-vikhroli-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment, Office Space\n\n₹ 1.93 Cr to 2.89 Cr\n\n![Lodha Riservo residential project in Vikhroli West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-riservo-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVikhroli West, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 3.65 Cr to 5.08 Cr\n\n![Lodha Altus residential project in Borivali West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-lodha-al