Gopi Birla Memorial School, Malabar Hill, Wilson College, Kamathipura, Walkeshwar Temple, Malabar Hill.\n\n### What makes Lodha Malabar unique?\n\nThe project combines a landmark Malabar Hill address, contemporary Art Deco-inspired architecture, panoramic sea views, Club Saint Amand, and personalized hospitality services to create an exclusive luxury residential experience.\n\n### What amenities are available at Lodha Malabar?\n\nResidents have access to Gymnasium, Swimming Pool, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Party Hall, Clubhouse, Rain Water Harvesting, Sewage Treatment Plant, along with the exclusive Club Saint Amand, hospitality services, wellness facilities, leisure spaces, and curated lifestyle experiences.\n\n### What is the possession status of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe project is currently Under Construction, with possession expected by Jun 2028.\n\n### What is the RERA registration number of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe project is registered under MahaRERA with registration number P51900034949, P51900055626.\n\n### Why should buyers consider Lodha Malabar?\n\nIts iconic Walkeshwar Road location, uninterrupted sea views, limited collection of luxury residences, Art Deco-inspired architecture, and hospitality-led lifestyle make Lodha Malabar one of South Mumbai's most distinguished residential developments.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/RealtyNXT/posts/news-lodha-developers-has-secured-development-rights-in-malabar-hill-for-rs-1061/1374259188052104","title":"Lodha Developers has secured development rights in Malabar Hill ...","raw_content":"## Realty NXT's Post\n\n---\n\n### **[Realty NXT](https://www.facebook.com/RealtyNXT?__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=-]C%2CP-R)** is with **[Lodha](https://www.facebook.com/Lodha?__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=-]C%2CP-R)** in **[Malabar Hill, Mumbai](https://www.facebook.com/Malabar-Hill-Mumbai-206339242726036/?__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=kC%2CP-R)**.\n\n[February 25](https://www.facebook.com/RealtyNXT/posts/pfbid02BmCcRUJK5XqR9BLtNB9ggg691u4sZhdSttxvsYjRg69aY6LQxWtdHt8LgiwNSKftl?__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=%2CO%2CP-R)  ·\n\n[#News](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/news?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) | Lodha Developers has secured development rights in Malabar Hill for Rs 106.12 crore from Sorabji Kanga Charity Trust, covering 17,403.20 sq m. The deal includes 5,017 sq m Rera area, 150 parking spaces, 42.5% trust share, Rs 621.71 crore valuation, Rs 37.42 crore stamp duty (Jan 7, 2026). Under DCPR 2034, 38,990.48 sq m will be handed to MHADA. In 2025, Malabar Hill saw 41 deals worth Rs 1,038 crore; Q4 rates rose to Rs 137,500/sq ft from Rs 98,566. Lodha also signed a Rs 364.80 crore JDA in Parel-Sewree spanning 41,526.07 sq m.\n\n[Lodha, Malabarhill, Mumbai, Redevelopment, Realty, FSI, Mhada, Rera, Investment, Valuation]\n\n[#RealtyNXT](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/realtynxt?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#MumbaiRealEstate](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/mumbairealestate?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#LodhaDevelopers](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/lodhadevelopers?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#MalabarHill](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/malabarhill?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#RealEstateIndia](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/realestateindia?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#PropertyNews](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/propertynews?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#Redevelopment](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/redevelopment?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7S&__tn__=*NK-R) [#LuxuryRealty](https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/luxuryrealty?__eep__=6&__cft__[0]=AZhfg1LhhGq1GGQKbETOKo3VKKwCoy66u6D38zX7KryI1gb7BpDmsamiFpFPXxJwaczst2fbM5U1jGsCeCQpqVewPzTvFZOnLvUOZS9vGsMny2japUdHvriXTEEhO71u7yUnbgbF1VFDHVorkskh4pNBbLNkAx7