find your dream property in Mumbai.\n\n## Properties\n\n## Buyer Tools\n\n## Market Intelligence\n\n## Company","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/project-lodha-waterview-for-sale-in-mumbai-pppfs","title":"2 Flats for Sale in Lodha Waterview, Mumbai - Flats Price in Lodha Waterview","raw_content":"# Flats for Sale in Lodha Waterview, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\n![Buy 3 BHK Resale Flat in  Lodha Waterview Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/2025/12/18/Project-Photo-5-Lodha-Waterview-Mumbai-5440935_431_600_310_462.jpeg \"Buy 3 BHK Resale Flat in  Lodha Waterview Mumbai\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Lodha Waterview, Teen Batti, Mumbai\n\nan ultraluxury, underconstruction residential development by Lodha Group located at Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai, scheduled for completion by mid2027. Set on a rare, large land parcel, this project features 36, 4 and 5bedroom apartments, with 2 buildings reaching 31 storeys, offering unparalleled, panoramic views of the Arabian Sea and Queens Necklace.  Nearby Landmark: opposite the Governors Estate Raj Bhavan.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-2470-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Teen-Batti-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834363138313237)\n\n![Buy 5 BHK Resale Flat in  Lodha Waterview Mumbai](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h310_w462/2025/12/18/Project-Photo-7-Lodha-Waterview-Mumbai-5440935_431_600_310_462.jpeg \"Buy 5 BHK Resale Flat in  Lodha Waterview Mumbai\")\n\n## 5 BHK Flat for Sale in Lodha Waterview, Malabar Hill, Mumbai\n\nSuper Luxury Sea view 6bhk Bareshell apartment in Malabar location, Low density project.   \n  \nNow available for sale: this 5 BHK apartment in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.It enjoys a prime location within Lodha Waterview. This top-notch 5 BHK property comes with 6 covered parking space for your vehicle. This ready to move flat in Malabar Hill is available for a price of ₹99.99 Cr. This unit occupies 14 floor with carpet area of total 9300 sqft. This property is equipped with power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, air conditioned, visitor parking, intercom facility. The project is RERA approved and P51900055626 is the RERA number of the society.   Nearby Landmark: Malabar Hill.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/5-BHK-9400-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835383236313935)\n\n![3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Runwal Malabar at Malabar Hill](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/2026/Sep/04/Photo_h180_w240/86296925_10_PropertyImage944-1417408055078_180_240.jpg \"3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Runwal Malabar at Malabar Hill\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill Mumbai\n\nThe 3 BHK flat is available for sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.This apartment in one of the significant areas of Malabar Hill is under construction, and can be purchased at the price of ₹26.49 Cr. The date of possession of the flat stands at Jun '32. Located on 20 floor, this apartment offers carpet area of 2400 sqft. The flat contains power back up, security. PR1170002502441 is the RERA number of the project. The project features 3,5 bhk flats properties, priced across the ₹30 Cr Onwards range.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-2400-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423836323936393235)\n\n![3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Lodha Seamont at Malabar Hill](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/2026/Mar/21/Photo_h180_w240/83886171_8_hatsAppImage20260318at11.54.40AM2_180_240.jpeg \"3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Lodha Seamont at Malabar Hill\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill Mumbai\n\nA 3 BHK apartment is available for sale in Malabar Hill, Mumbai.This well designed apartment is located within Lodha Seamont. You get free 3 covered parking space(s) for you car along with this 3 BHK apartment. You can buy this ready to move flat in Malabar Hill at price of ₹22.27 Cr. The unit is located on 12 floor featuring carpet area 1359 sqft. The flat features power back up, reserved parking, security, service/goods lift, air conditioned, visitor parking, intercom facility. This is a RERA approved project and P51900010326 is the RERA number. Properties in Lodha Seamont come in 3,4 bhk flats, with prices spanning ₹10.78 Cr - ₹18.13 Cr.   Nearby Landmark: Walkeshwar Rd, near Raj Bhavan, Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-2200-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423833383836313731)\n\n![3BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Runwal Malabar at Teen Batti](https://img.staticmb.com/mbphoto/property/cropped_images/2026/Aug/21/Photo_h180_w240/84612361_2_un1_180_240.jpg \"3BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Runwal Malabar at Teen Batti\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Teen Batti Mumbai\n\nan ultraluxury, lowdensity residential project in South Mumbai featuring 11 exclusive Sky Mansions. Situated near the Governors Estate and Walkeshwar, it offers 3 BHK simplex and 5 BHK duplex homes with 270 Arabian Sea views. The 34storey tower, set for completion by 2032, features one apartment per floor for maximum privacy  Nearby Landmark: near jain mandir Walkeshwar Malabar Hill belt.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-2600-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Teen-Batti-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834363132333631)\n\n![2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Malabar Hill](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Malabar Hill\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill Mumbai\n\nA well planned spacious 2bhk without any wastage. Comes with 1 car park. Prime location of malabar hill   \n  \nSituated in the prime location of Malabar Hill, the 2 BHK flat is currently available on sale.The 1 covered parking place for you car is included with this 2 BHK flat. This ready to move flat is offered at a price of ₹7 Cr. The property is on 4 floor and has carpet area 1050 sqft. The flat contains reserved parking, visitor parking, intercom facility.   Nearby Landmark: Malabar hill club.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1300-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835363934363237)\n\n![3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Malabar Hill](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"3BHK Multistorey Apartment for Resale in Malabar Hill\")\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Malabar Hill Mumbai\n\nSpacious 3bhk apartment in prime location of Mumbai , Malabar hill , little gibbs road , comes with 2 car parks.   \n  \nThis 3 BHK apartment in Malabar Hill, Mumbai is available for sale.2 covered parking space is provided to park your vehicle with this 3 BHK apartment. This ready to move flat located in Malabar Hill is available at the price of ₹12.95 Cr. This property sits on 4 floor with a total carpet area of 1850 sqft. This property includes reserved parking, security, air conditioned, visitor parking, intercom facility.   Nearby Landmark: Malabar hill club.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/3-BHK-2200-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Malabar-Hill-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835363934323737)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Walkeshwar Mumbai\n\nAn Elegant 2 BHK flat located in Walkeshwar, Mumbai is now available for sale.This ready to move flat in Walkeshwar comes at a price of ₹8.50 Cr. The unit is located on 5 floor featuring carpet area 1399 sqft.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1400-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Walkeshwar-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834333633323639)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Walkeshwar Mumbai\n\nA beautiful 2 BHK flat in Walkeshwar is currently available for sale.This ready to move flat in Walkeshwar comes at a price of ₹6.75 Cr. The unit is located on 3 floor featuring carpet area 1064 sqft.    [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1065-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Walkeshwar-in-Mumbai&id=4d423834323635343239)\n\n![5BHK Multistorey Apartment for New Property in Kalpataru Azuro at Malabar Hil